  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "クリスマス雑貨のコーナーか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700440010,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい\r\n目に入ったので",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040220050",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490170044/4901700440010"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700440020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……せっかくだし、机にひとつ、何か置くのも\r\n季節感が出て素敵かもって思ったんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170044/4901700440020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700440030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "改めて見ると\r\nこんなにたくさん種類があるんですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170044/4901700440030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに\r\nお、結構シンプルなのもあるんだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺もデスクに何か飾ってみようかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "参考までに聞きたいんだけど\r\n小糸は、どういう飾りを置くのがいいと思う？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700440040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "えっと……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170044/4901700440040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、ごめん。急に聞かれても困るよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700440050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "い、いえ！　困るとかじゃなくて\r\nデスクの上がどんなだったか思い出してて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170044/4901700440050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700440060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "書類がいっぱいあったはずだから\r\n滑らない素材がいいのかな、とか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170044/4901700440060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700440070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "音や光が出るものは\r\nやめたほうがいいのかなとか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170044/4901700440070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700440080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……す、すみません、黙り込んじゃって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170044/4901700440080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、考えてくれてありがとう\r\n小糸の言うとおり、デスクの状態によるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よければ、事務所に戻ってから\r\n改めて相談にのってもらってもいいかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700440090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……！\r\nは、はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170044/4901700440090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700440100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "もちろんです、任せてください……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
